<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pasminco strong performance continues.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pasminco strong performance continues.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Base metals miner Pasminco Ltd said on Wednesday that its strong performance over the year to June 30 was continuing in the first quarter of the 1996/97 year.</p>
<p>Pasminco earlier announced a surge in net profit to A$40.8 million for 1995/96, up from A$12.2 million in 1994/95.  </p>
<p>&quot;We've maintained the momentum we had at the end of last year,&quot; managing director David Stewart reported at a media briefing.</p>
<p>However, he noted there were some emerging pressures on earnings from further weakening in the price of zinc and the recent appreciation in the Australian dollar.</p>
</text>
